Issue #3576381: Ensure that URL access checks respect the language in the URL,
remove global language state changes in
ConfigurableLanguageManager::getLanguageSwitchLinks().

Backport of MR !16451 (commits 01-10, state of 2026-10-19) squashed for
Drupal 11.4. Test changes are left out because they target core main and do
not apply to 11.4. The access manager and arguments resolver services use
explicit arguments instead of autowiring.

https://www.drupal.org/project/drupal/issues/3576381

